WEBVTT

00:04:29.210 --> 00:04:31.944
Clearly, we weren't alone in our outrage.

00:04:32.615 --> 00:04:36.276
But as expected, I was forced to resign.

00:04:36.300 --> 00:04:38.291
(Laughter)

00:04:38.315 --> 00:04:40.609
And a year later, nothing's changed.

00:04:40.633 --> 00:04:43.315
"The Denver Post"
is but a few lone journalists

00:04:43.339 --> 00:04:47.879
doing their admirable best
in this husk of a once-great paper.

00:04:49.411 --> 00:04:54.299
Now, at least some of you
are thinking to yourself,

00:04:54.323 --> 00:04:55.481
"So what?"

00:04:55.505 --> 00:04:56.662
Right?

00:04:56.686 --> 00:04:57.838
So what?

00:04:57.862 --> 00:04:59.878
Let this dying industry die.

00:04:59.902 --> 00:05:01.436
And I kind of get that.